Next step
---------
S5-07 remains blocked because the counted common-ID comparator still reports
unexplained machine/UART differences. If the next question is whether this
specific write fault's handler installs the missing mapping before retry, the
existing exact-nonce replay can add
`--execution-observations-post-iret-index 30`; require
`post_iret_page_walk_status=captured`, matching fault identity and a successful
post-IRET write translation. That would not explain why the source run 1 did
not fault at the corresponding stack setup and does not justify relaxing the
comparator.
